step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Speak to Lucien in the Flying Horse Inn in the north-west corner of East Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the temple directly south of the Ranging Guild by climbing down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west down the stairs, slash the web, and take the boots of lightness (light source and knife or slash weapon required).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back upstairs, then through the north gate with the pendant of Lucien equipped.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Cross the lava bridge wearing the boots of lightness (weight must be -1&nbsp;kg or less or you will not be able to cross and take 20 damage from falling), open the Large door, and take the lever.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Speak to Lucien in the Flying Horse Inn in the north-west corner of East Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the temple directly south of the Ranging Guild by climbing down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west down the stairs, slash the web, and take the boots of lightness (light source and knife or slash weapon required).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back upstairs, then through the north gate with the pendant of Lucien equipped.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cross the lava bridge wearing the boots of lightness (weight must be -1&nbsp;kg or less or you will not be able to cross and take 20 damage from falling), open the Large door, and take the lever.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Cross the lava bridge again and attach the lever to the lever-bracket on the wall a bit west of the ladder you climbed to enter the dungeon.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Speak to Lucien in the Flying Horse Inn in the north-west corner of East Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the temple directly south of the Ranging Guild by climbing down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west down the stairs, slash the web, and take the boots of lightness (light source and knife or slash weapon required).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back upstairs, then through the north gate with the pendant of Lucien equipped.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cross the lava bridge wearing the boots of lightness (weight must be -1&nbsp;kg or less or you will not be able to cross and take 20 damage from falling), open the Large door, and take the lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cross the lava bridge again and attach the lever to the lever-bracket on the wall a bit west of the ladder you climbed to enter the dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Pull the lever after attaching it. You will receive the prompt: "You hear the clunking of some hidden machinery."</col>
