line	<str>Pull the lever after attaching it. You will receive the prompt: "You hear the clunking of some hidden machinery."</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the south gate and follow the path.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search chests along the icy path to obtain ice arrows. 16 with Ava's device and 60+ Ranged is enough.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back through the north gate with the pendant of Lucien equipped.</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue straight north to a small room containing a lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Right-click the lever and search for traps. (Requires 42 Thieving) Then pull the lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west then north through the doors.</str>
line	
line	<str>A Fire Warrior of Lesarkus will spawn in the room upon attempting to enter the second door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill him with your ice arrows.</str>
line	
line	<str>Give Winelda 20 unnoted limpwurt roots all at once. She will teleport you to the other side of the lava.</str>
line	
line	<str>Optional: follow the path to its end and take the shiny key to access this dungeon from McGrubor's Wood.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the wall to the north leading to a room full of Guardians of Armadyl.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick the good or evil path.</str>
line	
line	<str>Remove your pendant of Lucien and talk to a Guardian of Armadyl.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Enter the building west of the <col=800000>Grand Exchange</col> wearing your <col=800000>Armadyl pendant</col> and kill <col=800000>Lucien</col> (level 14).</col>
